            "review_title": "Review at Wakana Sushi",
            "review_text": "Barcelona027\nSabadell, Spain844 contributions\n0\nJapan overrated\nAug 2024 • Couples\nWe found on googlemaps the top rated Japanese restaurant.\n\nNearby are several places where ladies insistently offer services, so we were about not to go.\n\nVery Japanese atmosphere and very broad letter, although you can only ask for what the boss wants (or has).\n\nPrices without local tax and abusive card surcharge (5%).\n\nLots of fries and little quantity.\nRead more\nTranslated from Spanish\nShow original\nWritten August 13, 2024",
