            "review_title": "Review at Wakana Sushi",
            "review_text": "Clifford Marhefke\nBrookfield, Wisconsin8 contributions\n0\nThe Restaurant Wakana is excelent - try it.\nOct 2019\nThis is an excellent Japanese Restaurant. They have an excellent selection on their menu but if you ask for something not on the menu, I am certain they would accommodate you if possible.\n\nIt is a short distance off the main street, but worth the short walk. The restaurant serves alcohol and there is an associated karaoke bar by the name Wakana that is located directly behind the restaurant.\n\nAlone or with friends or family, I do not think you will go wrong here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 17, 2020",
